MODIFICATIONS
-------------
This is a MODIFIED version of the Original Work. Changes relative to the
upstream "magento/inventory" project include, but are not limited to:

  * The Default Stock (stock 1) is indexed and managed like any other stock,
    and MSI no longer reads or writes the legacy "cataloginventory_*" tables.
  * Source-level reservations, salable quantity by source, an adjustment
    history of every stock change and a storefront stock visualizer.
  * Bug fixes and performance improvements, including community contributions
    taken from pull requests that were still open in the upstream project.
    Their authors keep their copyright. Commits taken from them carry a
    "[picked #NNNN]" marker with the upstream pull request number.
  * Repackaging the 77 modules under the "jeanmarcos/msi-core" Composer
    package, which replaces the individual "magento/module-inventory-*" and
    "mage-os/module-inventory-*" packages.
  * Removal of the proprietary "InventoryRequisitionList" module, which is
    NOT covered by the OSL-3.0 / AFL-3.0 open source license.
  * Removal of the "InventoryLogging" module, which targets the Adobe Commerce
    "Magento_Logging" module and is excluded from the upstream Open Source
    metapackage; it is omitted here to keep the package compatible with
    Magento Open Source.

